{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated:\n\n**Brightdesk**\nStrong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n\n**Orbitly**\nTeams use its forms and boards as a basic request tracker.\n\n**Tallyfox**\nA CRM first; the inbox add-on is a good fit when the same small team handles sales and support.\n\n**Halcyon Sales**\nFocused on selling, with only basic ticket handling.\n\nBrightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Orbitly is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f0-77dc-8172-f0ef083b2f66","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:54.450Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox vs help desk","shared inbox collision detection"],"latency_ms":12720,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[99,109],[435,445]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[183,190],[483,490]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[255,263]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."